# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Huapuka kākau: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), laina-hou.
Huapuka kākau: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), laina-hou.
Huapuka kākau: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), laina-hou.
Huapuka kākau: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), laina-hou.
Huapuka kākau: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), laina-hou.
Huapuka kākau: ([''] tccompare: ['']), laina-hou.
